WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.290
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:14.790
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.630
It's my day!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:27.200
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.610
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:41.990
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:49.390
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:55.170
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:02.310
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.810
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.950
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.020
I just want to walk

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.560
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.530
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:35.440
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.880
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.150
It's my day!

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:12.110
Wow, what a beautiful moon!

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.540
And look at all the stars!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.680
Aren't you glad you came?

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:23.790
Yeah...

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:28.120
Come on... Eat up! Drink up!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:37.160
"Deep Wounds of the Heart"

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:44.740
What's wrong? Can't the three of you
be more cheerful?

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.700
Come on, everybody!
Eat, drink and be merry!

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.280
Let's have fun!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.930
C'mon! Eat up, Tsukushi!

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.890
<i>You call this fun?</i>

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.730
<i>If only those two were here...</i>

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.600
<i>Let's have a party!</i>

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.650
Tsukushi! Serve the tea, will you?

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.610
Huh? Uh... Oh!

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:28.860
Here you go.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:29.650
Thank you.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.590
You two make such a nice couple.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.880
Tsukasa, should you be
drinking like that?

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.840
<i>What's wrong with that guy?</i>

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:00.210
<i>He's been glaring at me
ever since we got in that car.</i>

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:02.750
<i>What have I done to deserve that?</i>

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.940
Rui Hanazawa, say something
to liven things up.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:09.560
Huh?

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:14.070
What do you mean "Huh"?
Come on... Anything.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:18.390
<i>Someone lighten the mood already!</i>

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.210
Uh...

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:25.640
Uh-huh.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:34.890
Can I go for a soak?

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:40.540
Go right ahead.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:43.050
The men's bath is down the hall
to the right.

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:46.690
I'll see you later.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:54.060
<i>Rui Hanazawa!
You're leaving me with them?!</i>

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:57.630
Why don't you go on with him?

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:07.310
After all, he's the guy you said
you can sit and do nothing with, right?

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.540
The guy that you liked.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.980
Isn't that right? It's him?

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:23.990
<i>This subject was off-limits for so long.
How should I react?</i>

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:30.530
Oh, yeah...
You had a crush on him, didn't you?

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.320
I was right!

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:48.700
Let's do a compatibility check
on Tsukushi and Rui later!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.150
Since we're staying overnight...
It's a great opportunity.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.770
<i>Opportunity?</i>

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.690
But first...

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:05.130
That toy... Are you nuts?

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:10.010
Say... Why don't we go and
have a bath, too?

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.300
Nuh-uh.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:18.580
<i>I'm such a fool.
Why am I in a daze?</i>

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:21.510
It's okay. I'll go with Tsukushi.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:25.020
Let's go, Tsukushi.

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:26.220
All right...

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:29.020
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:40.400
Oh, this is so nice and warm!
It's wonderful!

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:55.160
Aah! It's cold! Sure feels good!

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.990
<i>You had a crush on him, didn't you?</i>

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.370
What's wrong, Tsukushi?
You're so quiet.

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:22.210
It's nothing...

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:25.060
I was just admiring your family.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:28.470
How wonderful to have a villa
with a hot-spring bath!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:32.270
You think so?
But this place is so old.

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:34.000
It's been here
since the Meiji era.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.290
The ceiling is about to collapse.
It's scary.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.680
I told them we should rebuild...

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:43.530
but they said it would soon
be declared a cultural asset.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.160
Shigeru...

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:58.120
Shigeru... It's great
about you and Domyoji.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.890
Tsukushi, do you really think so?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:03.580
Of course.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:06.560
Thank you!

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.520
<i>Liar!</i>

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:27.140
<i>I... I'm hurt.</i>

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:33.890
<i>If she means nothing to you,
you can kiss me, can't you?</i>

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.450
<i>When I saw them kiss...</i>

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:54.160
<i>...it put a scar somewhere on my body.</i>

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:58.060
<i>I love you.</i>

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.270
<i>I love you.</i>

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:07.540
<i>I'll go to the ends of the earth
to find you.</i>

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:24.790
<i>His feelings were so heavy...
and smothering... that I ran away.</i>

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.330
<i>I used his family as an excuse.</i>

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:40.440
<i>Everything was settled.
I thought I would feel relieved...</i>

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:46.010
<i>I... I'm so selfish.</i>

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:51.750
Tsukushi!

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.590
If you stay in too long,
you'll... overheat...

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.330
Tsukushi!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.800
Hey! Help, somebody!

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:18.680
Tsukushi's fainted in the bath!

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:22.850
The bath? Where is it?

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.870
At the end of the hall,
to the right.

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:45.860
She seems fine. I don't think
she swallowed any water, either.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.690
Shigeru, show them to their room.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:54.330
O-okay...

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:55.630
Where?

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:58.340
Down there.
Turn right at the corner.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.590
I don't feel good.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:58.030
Have some water.

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:02.000
Thanks.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:14.270
I...

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:18.420
You got overheated and fainted.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.050
I see...

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:22.720
I...

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:27.690
I was in the bath, and I...

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:29.490
And I...

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:48.180
Your robe's by your pillow.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.160
<i>No! Why?</i>

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:54.010
<i>I know you can't take a bath
with your clothes on, but...</i>

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:04.290
Did you save me, Rui Hanazawa?

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:05.290
Yeah...

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.600
No way!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.840
Y-You... saw?

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:19.340
I did. I couldn't help it
in that situation.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:33.090
<i>He saw... He saw all of me!</i>

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:46.730
<i>It couldn't be helped?</i>

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:48.670
<i>Usually, you'd get someone
of the same sex...</i>

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.740
Where's Shigeru?

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.180
Oh, she's probably
asleep by now.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:02.850
She's rooming with Tsukasa,
and I'll be rooming with you.

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:08.320
Rooming? It's not a dorm...

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:15.330
I... I'll talk to Shigeru.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:19.900
Don't. They could be busy right now.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.170
Busy?

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:36.480
Oh, right! I'm so thoughtless...

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.250
Of course,
if you want to stop them...

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:42.220
Shall I kick down their door for you?

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.590
Why would I stop them?

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:50.860
You've been been on 
the verge of tears all night.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.360
Tsukasa?

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.180
Hey, Tsukasa!

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:27.990
What do you want?

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:40.150
My mom says I should live with you...

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:45.110
and train to be a good wife,
for the four years we're in college.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:08.430
If we can't wait four years, she says we can
get married while we're still in college.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.890
Is that what you want?

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:41.830
Or are you just walking the path
laid down by your parents?

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:49.400
Tsukasa?

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:54.010
Of course, I can't point fingers.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:59.280
My future's set. I don't have to worry
about getting into college.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:05.320
You mean, you want to choose
the girl you love?

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:09.960
But, you chose me, didn't you?

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:17.660
Why are you saying this now?!

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:26.840
Look at me!

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:10.050
<i>I don't have enough faith
in my feelings for Domyoji...</i>

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:11.920
<i>to kick their door down.</i>

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.510
Rui Hanazawa, are you asleep?

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:36.580
Not yet.

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:43.210
Too bad there weren't two sets
of bedding.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.080
It's okay. It's nice and warm.

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:52.350
This house is drafty.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.750
Can I... hold your hand?

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:16.440
Sure...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:25.050
<i>Tonight... I'm gaining another scar.</i>

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:35.560
<i>Maybe he's the one...</i>

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:43.540
<i>...that can heal it, after all.</i>

00:21:56.480 --> 00:22:03.080
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:07.830
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:17.300
Some day, the whole world

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:23.110
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:30.860
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:30.860 --> 00:22:36.480
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:43.100
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:49.500
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:56.400
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:56.400 --> 00:23:05.280
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:06.560 --> 00:23:13.190
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:19.250
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:26.510
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:29.900
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:35.770
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:47.620
I couldn't sleep a wink last night.

00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:50.330
I'm so uncomfortable with Domyoji...

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:53.430
And Shigeru is acting a bit weird.

00:23:54.130 --> 00:23:55.430
Last night, those two...

00:23:56.300 --> 00:24:00.700
Ooh! I hate this!
Why did I have to see that?!

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:04.010
Hana Yori Dango: 
"You're Not the One."

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:06.440
Why is it getting on my nerves?!
